      "content": "it's not that bad really... i'm just worried about the side effects of pills. if i really wanted to try a natural approach, like using a heavy layer of medical grade honey and maybe some garlic oil, wouldn't that be strong enough to kill the bacteria? i just feel like my body can handle it if i give it the right natural stuff.",
